{'symbol': 'EMR', 'date': '2022-01-25 09:00:00', 'title': "EMERSON'S SENSI™ TOUCH SMART THERMOSTAT WINS AHRI 2021 INTEGRATED HOME COMPETITION", 'text': "ST. LOUIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EMERSON (NYSE: EMR), A LEADER IN HEATING, VENTILATION AND AIR CONDITIONING TECHNOLOGIES AND SOLUTIONS, ANNOUNCED ITS SENSI™ TOUCH SMART THERMOSTAT HAS BEEN SELECTED BY THE AIR CONDITIONING, HEATING AND REFRIGERATION INSTITUTE (AHRI) AS A WINNER FOR THE 2021 INTEGRATED HOME COMPETITION. THE FIRST SMART THERMOSTAT TO BE NAMED ENERGY STAR® PARTNER OF THE YEAR FROM THE U.S. ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION AGENCY AND THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF ENERGY, EMERSON'S SENSI SMART THERMOSTA"}